WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.147
"Wait here," said Dog.

2
00:00:14.148 --> 00:00:20.656
He ran into the barn.

3
00:00:20.657 --> 00:00:26.464
"Don't worry, Cat!" called Cow.

4
00:00:26.465 --> 00:00:29.464
"We will help!" called Pig.

5
00:00:29.465 --> 00:00:33.611
"Meow!" cried Cat.

6
00:00:33.612 --> 00:00:36.204
It was dark in the well.

7
00:00:36.205 --> 00:00:38.887
It was cold in the well.

8
00:00:38.888 --> 00:00:42.302
Soon Dog came back.

9
00:00:42.303 --> 00:00:46.657
He had two things.

10
00:00:46.658 --> 00:00:49.426
"Look," said Dog.

11
00:00:49.427 --> 00:00:51.910
"I have a rope.

12
00:00:51.911 --> 00:00:54.667
And I have a pail."

13
00:00:54.668 --> 00:00:57.298
"Oh!" said Cow.

14
00:00:57.299 --> 00:01:00.381
"We can tie the rope . . ."

15
00:01:00.382 --> 00:01:04.221
"To the pail!" said Pig.

16
00:01:04.222 --> 00:01:14.952
"Yes!" said Dog.

17
00:01:14.953 --> 00:01:17.258
They held the rope.

18
00:01:17.259 --> 00:01:21.464
Slowly the pail went down.

19
00:01:21.465 --> 00:01:25.983
Cat saw the pail.

20
00:01:25.984 --> 00:01:30.586
She jumped into it.

21
00:01:30.587 --> 00:01:38.568
And . . .

22
00:01:38.569 --> 00:01:40.890
Up came Cat!

23
00:01:40.891 --> 00:01:44.817
"Yay!" said Pig.

24
00:01:44.818 --> 00:01:48.420
"My wish came true!"

25
00:01:48.421 --> 00:01:51.566
"Yes, Pig," said Dog.

26
00:01:51.567 --> 00:01:57.511
"Your wish came true!"

